{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39905","headline":"郡庭惜牡丹 · 徐夤","name":"郡庭惜牡丹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"肠断东风落牡丹，爲祥爲瑞久留难。\n青春不驻堪垂泪，红艳已空犹倚栏。\n积藓下销香蘂尽，晴阳高照露华乾。\n明年万叶千枝长，倍发芳菲借客看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39905.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39905","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}